Source: drobo-rutils
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Peter Silva <Peter.A.Silva@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), libxcb1-dev, libx11-dev, libssl-dev, pkg-config
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/peter/drobo-rutils

Package: drobocli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Command-line management tool for Drobo storage units (Rust)
 drobocli is a modern Rust command-line tool for Data Robotics Drobo
 storage arrays. It allows querying unit status, drive slot LEDs, LUNs,
 updating options, blinking lights, and dumping diagnostics.

Package: drobogui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Graphical dashboard for Drobo storage units (Rust)
 drobogui is a fast, reactive desktop dashboard built with egui for
 monitoring and configuring Drobo storage units. It provides drive bay
 visualization, format script generation, option settings, and diagnostic viewers.

Package: librust-droboapi-dev
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Drobo SCSI API library for Rust
 droboapi provides safe Rust abstractions for communicating with Drobo
 storage units over Linux SCSI generic (sg) ioctls.
